---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Résumé
description: A concise view of experience, projects, education, and skills, with an editable LaTeX résumé.
permalink: /resume/
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">The professional overview</p>
    <h1>Experience, at a glance.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A concise view of your background, with room for the contributions that matter most.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      {% if site.resumePdf %}<a class="button" href="{{ site.resumePdf | url }}" download>Download résumé PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>{% endif %}
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="{{ '/assets/resume/resume.tex' | url }}" download>Download LaTeX source <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="resume-preview" aria-label="Résumé template">
    <header class="resume-header">
      <p class="section-label">{% if site.resumeTemplate %}Résumé template{% else %}Résumé{% endif %}</p>
      <h2>{{ site.name }}</h2>
      <p>{{ site.role }} <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> {{ site.location }}</p>
      {% if site.email %}<a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>{% endif %}
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <section>
        <h3>Profile</h3>
        <p>Write a short professional summary: your focus, relevant experience, and the kinds of questions your work helps answer.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>Experience</h3>
        <p><strong>Your job title · Your organization</strong><br><span class="muted">Start date — End date</span></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Describe a problem, your contribution, and the resulting deliverable.</li>
          <li>Add an outcome you can substantiate, with context for any metrics.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Your previous job title · Your organization</strong><br><span class="muted">Start date — End date</span></p>
        <ul><li>Summarize relevant responsibilities and the decisions your work supported.</li></ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>Selected projects</h3>
        <p><strong>Your analytics project</strong><br>State the question, your method, and the most useful result. Link to a project page with the supporting work.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">Browse project case studies <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>Education & credentials</h3>
        {% for credential in credentials %}<p><strong>{{ credential.title }}</strong><br>{{ credential.issuer }} · {{ credential.year }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </section>
      <section>
        <h3>Skills</h3>
        <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> Your analytical methods.<br><strong>Tools:</strong> Your languages, databases, and visualization tools.<br><strong>Communication:</strong> Your reporting and collaboration skills.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
    {% if site.resumeTemplate %}<p class="example-notice">This is a résumé template. Replace the placeholder text with your own experience before sharing.</p>{% endif %}
  </article>
</div>
